[{"title":"二酉园","author":"林大春","text":"泽国天开翼轸墟，凭将先子命藏书。\n空中楼阁罗星象，海内文章列地舆。\n五岳风清歌凤外，三山云起卧龙初。\n主人游玩应无厌，不说神宫洞府居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11447,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天尺楼","author":"林大春","text":"高筑危楼霄汉间，飞甍咫尺近天颜。\n登临赋客留新制，邂逅仙人讲大还。\n宸翰几惊神物护，丹心聊与彩云閒。\n先忧后乐吾曹事，须记岳阳镇禹山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11448,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"季夏之初澄海陈生泛舟来访会海阳萧生书至自郡因遂赋此","author":"林大春","text":"绿池香动碧荷风，挂席遥驰到海东。\n漫道说诗似刘向，谁知问字过扬雄。\n冰弦引满彤云外，玉树飞英紫气中。\n夜静忽闻箫史曲，欲乘双凤入高空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11449,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安秋月","author":"林大春","text":"乾坤万里绝纤埃，塞外凉飙动地来。\n良夜腾腾飞玉魄，清辉隐隐上金台。\n连天水色关山静，几处芦花鸿雁哀。\n抚景漫思青女态，临文空愧谢庄才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11450,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和林广文寄咏庭莲用韵","author":"林大春","text":"步月披星到草堂，微闻露气藕花香。\n荷衣半偃鹿眠稳，翠盖轻摇鹤唳长。\n施绛五年犹是客，草玄三世竟为郎。\n谁知雅调凌云起，会见丹心与绣肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11451,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴生光卿斋为风雨所破旋葺成之予过见壁上多有题咏因走笔赋此以赠","author":"林大春","text":"清斋四壁金风起，雅调高朋玉露收。\n烂漫珠玑山鬼泣，淋漓翰墨海天愁。\n斗间龙隐张华剑，屋里貂寒季子裘。\n不见洛阳年少客，立谈挥涕动宸旒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11452,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夜邀孙比部李山人园林小集","author":"林大春","text":"盈盈皓魄隐林端，今夕何期此共看。\n海岳游人探玉烛，江湖迁客忆金銮。\n歌声入座停云袅，桂影浮空满露团。\n休问行藏怅歧路，天涯相聚尽新欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11453,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"献岁春前王郡公还自惠州以书见贻有虚馆相迎语作此谢之","author":"林大春","text":"瑶华飞坠报先春，为筑金台迓野人。\n却笑嵇生态疏放，徒惭逸少意清真。\n烟销翠岭麟游远，月转沧江鹤梦频。\n见说郡斋无个事，高名偏映御屏新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11454,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王郡公以人日见贻诗箑依韵奉酬","author":"林大春","text":"野旷天空万籁闻，谁传笔阵扫千军。\n轻摇白羽团侵月，细洒阳春调入云。\n赠我宁论青玉案，酣歌何待紫榴裙。\n瞻言百里知何日，独倚龙光望斗文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11455,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李山人春日别予郊居以诗画寄予作此答之","author":"林大春","text":"曾陪仙客醉辞林，此日南来泛海心。\n徙鳄溪头频倚剑，眠牛陇上忆还金。\n青宵过我卿云合，长啸出门春草深。\n怅别诗成浑是画，况堪画里见骚吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11456,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春送孙比部至郡承郡公携觞过访即席口占为赠","author":"林大春","text":"扁舟送客滞江城，趣驾过予岂世情。\n拂袖珠玑看错落，充庭绮席任纵横。\n行藏往事孤怀在，邂逅新知感慨生。\n汉署冯唐容易老，何当召对入承明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11457,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凤城春夜辱劳使君邀集于金山精舍别归却寄是诗兼以为谢","author":"林大春","text":"玉树金城远市諠，画桥灯火使君轩。\n登堂乍解南州榻，入座频催北海樽。\n碧海龙蟠过夜雨，丹山凤啸起朝暾。\n平明忽挂归帆去，回首朱幡隔紫垣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11458,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄金生","author":"林大春","text":"故游何处望中迷，一札遥传浙水西。\n漫道终军方弱冠，谁怜仲蔚久幽栖。\n江云翠绕龙湫远，海日光涵凤岛低。\n何得重逢在霄汉，雄文亲睹御书题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11459,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题明府清渠宗兄别业","author":"林大春","text":"柴桑昔载追游地，此日渊明酒兴豪。\n松菊犹存三径老，琴书在御一堂高。\n池窥晓月鱼龙窟，竹覆秋云翡翠巢。\n莫道东山非大隐，时闻北海寄风骚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11460,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意","author":"林大春","text":"阿房紫光满，上林秋色遥。\n东方隐金马，季子敝黑貂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11461,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闺词","author":"林大春","text":"晓起见晴云，云山迥不分。\n垂帘且云卧，犹得梦夫君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11462,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春寄远","author":"林大春","text":"清夜江桥别，归舟失暝烟。\n那堪三月暮，独对落花前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11463,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋还自辽海至山海关赋得关山月留别陈司马四首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"微月昏出东，美人秋卧起。\n明发送征夫，飞刍渡辽水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11464,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋还自辽海至山海关赋得关山月留别陈司马四首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"清商动瑶瑟，秋光看欲满。\n骄虏闻已归，征夫应不远。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11465,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋还自辽海至山海关赋得关山月留别陈司马四首 其三","author":"林大春","text":"月出关门开，风高塞上回。\n停车看宝剑，下马接金杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11466,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋还自辽海至山海关赋得关山月留别陈司马四首 其四","author":"林大春","text":"东还复西去，相将总壮颜。\n青天悬玉镜，为我照榆关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11467,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"司马席上中秋","author":"林大春","text":"明月当空满，游人独未归。\n清歌振瑶席，坐客欲沾衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11468,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠萧兵马","author":"林大春","text":"花发上林苑，风清太液池。\n列侯同锡宴，亲记柏梁诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11469,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠盐寺僧","author":"林大春","text":"结社聊依郭，看经坐捲帘。\n时多山客至，定少水晶盐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11470,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海口抚琴","author":"林大春","text":"微雨渡江关，横琴坐云海。\n山水如有情，钟期复何在。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11471,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳湖","author":"林大春","text":"朝游湖水长，暮游湖水香。\n今朝苏学士，不让汲淮阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11472,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"便面二首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"古人重一物，可托千金交。\n虽云草木微，比德称琼瑶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11473,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"便面二首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"青山静如雾，飞泉何处来。\n声疑天外起，势散作风雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11474,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过萧锦衣北园五首 其一","author":"林大春","text":"万事干戈后，孤亭杳霭间。\n天留今日醉，人得片时閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11475,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过萧锦衣北园五首 其二","author":"林大春","text":"广园临碧沼，曲径绕青扉。\n竹雾笼金勒，松风护锦衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11476,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过萧锦衣北园五首 其三","author":"林大春","text":"夜直金銮月，朝眠玉塞云。\n于今灞陵尉，莫讶李将军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11477,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过萧锦衣北园五首 其四","author":"林大春","text":"枕石云犹冷，看花日未斜。\n应疑金谷胜，不是石崇家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11478,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过萧锦衣北园五首 其五","author":"林大春","text":"扶桑南海木，绛露满花团。\n何必思姚魏，春风羡牡丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11479,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东山小集以玻璃杯酌包少府少府雅博其趣遂举一赠之戏成二绝 其一","author":"林大春","text":"明珠空照乘，宝剑自凌云。\n此物能祛毒，因之持赠君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11480,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东山小集以玻璃杯酌包少府少府雅博其趣遂举一赠之戏成二绝 其二","author":"林大春","text":"玉瓒黄流美，金杯琥珀香。\n始知清庙器，不作野人觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":11481,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自嘲","author":"林大春","text":"翠竹迎风舞，山童见客呼。\n如何清夜月，清兴半分无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"